       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. QUALIFIED-NAMES.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 GROUP-A.
          05 ITEM-NAME PIC X(5).
       01 GROUP-B.
          05 ITEM-NAME PIC 9(3).
       01 TEXT-VALUE PIC X(5).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN.
           MOVE ITEM-NAME OF GROUP-A TO TEXT-VALUE.
           DISPLAY ITEM-NAME OF GROUP-B.
           DISPLAY ITEM-NAME.
           DISPLAY ITEM-NAME OF GROUP-C.
           STOP RUN.
       END PROGRAM QUALIFIED-NAMES.
